# FENNEC FOUNTAIN: every one of the fifty rooms is won with real button
# presses (the demo player holds the direction of each stored move), and
# the last room then earns the Saucer and, with all fifty drops, the Alien.
game fennec
wait 30
cheat room 1
wait 2
botuntil won == 1 2400
expect drops == 1
